#: rc.cpp:234
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<p>Here you can setup the audio CD ripping pattern which states how your ripped "
"tracks will be saved. The basic system allows setting of a standard pattern. If "
"you want to have full control over the pattern please use the advanced pattern "
"system."
